        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "This is almost certainly my fault so I'll try to have a look later today. I think the intention was that `*args, **kwargs` should exclude vectorcall on the basis that it's unlikely to be more efficient. But only the top-level `__init__` should count. And the top-level `__init__` isn't being correctly found.",
